# Optional. The Odds API (https://the-odds-api.com/).
# A free key can read featured game markets. Player props, and some books
# such as Fanatics, may require a paid plan. Do not put a real key in git.
# Leave this blank to run without live odds. The program will say the key
# is missing and will not invent prices.
#
# ESPN final stats use the public site API and do not need a key.
# Historical odds (GET /v4/historical/...) are a paid plan and are not called.
ODDS_API_KEY=
